      "text": "⚡ Core API (FastAPI Cluster)\nUvicorn Async Multi-Worker\n\n🛡️ Middleware:\n• Auth: JWT Bearer (python-jose)\n• Role-based Access Control (RBAC)\n• CORS Middleware\n• Prometheus /metrics\n• Pydantic Schema Validation\n\nServices:\n• Auth, Workspaces, Channels (DM)\n• WebSocket Engine (/ws/channels/*)\n• Read Receipts & Presence",
